{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98906cfeceda72e77b0bbc4e6d9ebddfcb4c12343c526e591f1e465335835076", "ja": "（志保のプロデュースした洋服が発売された。\n評判を受け、ファンとの交流イベントが開催された）", "zh": "（为志保制作的服装上市了。\n反响很好，还举办了与粉丝交流的活动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1001_fuxannojyosei", "source_sha256": "c60ede7889c31ec4c2650d53d82519623faa5ff8b2cb60df0c94283c45f5f9f8", "ja": "わあ～。こ、こんにちは、志保ちゃん！\nその……会えて嬉しいですっ！", "zh": "哇～。志、志保！\n那个……能见到你，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "dad773071d5b83284b36afcae004a0aedd1d8792c0cc6e04a6894f403d7da446", "ja": "こんにちは。服、着てきてくれたんですね。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "你好。你穿着那件衣服过来了啊。\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1003_fuxannojyosei", "source_sha256": "f8facd1ca262e32c42e898a4c611c0bcce0a3c104bae1215875e57621317516e", "ja": "うん。発表された瞬間に、すぐ予約しちゃった。\nこの服、とっても可愛くて大好きだよ。", "zh": "嗯。一公布的时候，我就立刻预购了。\n这件衣服非常可爱，我很喜欢哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "da188d9cedd31d6ecc97aa2c4196c1763422e3fef0222c4e48b016c25f6ecc87", "ja": "大好き……！　あ、ありがとうございます！\n大切に着てもらえると嬉しいです。", "zh": "非常喜欢……！谢、谢谢您！\n您能珍惜着穿它，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1005_null", "source_sha256": "494fa7cf2920e00f31d70c39f224838e92e217ce28d6551ddb665731e0695eca", "ja": "イベント終了後……", "zh": "活动结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1006_p", "source_sha256": "adc7f6014b1fb5293815ce1ac0746a98822c436f0213179364847275be994f36", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。\nファンの人達、すごく楽しそうだったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。\n粉丝们看起来都特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "de6f320a0c09dc673bc055e92e491e821a46df731ab8649c5cc2fe1eb9489cdd", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nそうですね。みなさん、ずっと笑顔だったんです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n是啊，大家一直都在笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "6514258e82c01819f2558cf00b9701f1f5301de4b856c139c2f363efcffa2a82", "ja": "それに感想も、温かい言葉ばかりで……。\n私まで嬉しくなりました。ふふっ。", "zh": "而且大家的感想也全都是温暖的话语……\n连我都跟着高兴起来了。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5b47abd1b1d78a5cd2e0a45b562f2291cf7f085fa60f7cbd2a3c2d154c6c9c28", "ja": "よかったな。たくさんの人が、\n志保の服を気に入ってくれたってことだ。", "zh": "太好了。看来有很多人都喜欢志保设计的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "534f097642d578741c9fd6ced886665b5a55ea6a62d2bd279d4111d5c0c0232f", "ja": "はい。同世代の子もいましたけど……\n私より年上の方が多かったのは、少し意外でした。", "zh": "是的。虽然也有和我同龄的孩子……\n但没想到比我年长的人更多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "439cc4206a8a97b524a50709299535479b336813450725fb47b2aca2dc65b35d", "ja": "多くの方が「久しぶりにこういう服を着た」と\n言っていて……。", "zh": "很多人都说“好久没穿过这种衣服了”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4e525910b731e3f2f26a40fd422b4c7bc698672f4edd1afd89442249a283beca", "ja": "もしかしたら……\n志保みたいな憧れを持った人達かもしれないな。", "zh": "说不定……\n她们也是怀着和志保一样的向往呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "5d2375ec0d12d11a4b77b67dbe6355d2c51f6aec82a074330b55c1a3d265bc6b", "ja": "……そう言えば、デザインを気に入ってるようでした。\nお姫様みたいで素敵だって。", "zh": "……这么说来，她们似乎很喜欢那个设计。\n还说像公主一样，非常棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0cb3cffb013ee969cdcb2d3b0dd31750b17fbf5ba0f38a057b9f80cb28f36bce", "ja": "そうか。今回、その人達が踏み出せたのは、\nきっと、志保が一生懸命考えたからだな。", "zh": "这样啊。这次，他们能迈出这一步，一定是因为志保认真思考过吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "52d273694a47354581cb2b5cac329de5063efc5c64f16a887b66aa65247266ef", "ja": "私が……。", "zh": "是我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4a249dce8530b68a1075a84c955565352bb0f0a9208e4d8d7950e50cf3800b17", "ja": "志保？", "zh": "志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "c7c17ccd75b3e0f97d475d8b22f705d5d4ee4eeff8e4cb1c04d852ab3c727d5a", "ja": "あっ。その、最初は少し心配してたんです。\n私の服を買ってくれる人がいるのかなって。", "zh": "啊。那个，一开始我其实有点担心。\n担心会不会有人愿意买我的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "841eb6c0f3403242e26100f71b71296dde1ca8774b24d07c50434379cb574ed8", "ja": "でも……そんな心配、要りませんでしたね。\n今日、たくさんの人と話せて本当によかった。", "zh": "不过……看来没必要担心呢。\n今天能和这么多人交谈，真的太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "e3da180ddae99782eb27c7582b54598ae0a313fdcc49c92360b971e30640c75e", "ja": "いくつになっても憧れる気持ちを忘れなくていい……。\nそのことにも気がつけて、嬉しかったです。", "zh": "无论到了几岁，都不用抛下向往的心情……\n能意识到这一点，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6ce0d171c208b8d458c4a63dae2ae3b7c6e157fd539678fc841cef346a037d14", "ja": "ああ。志保が大人になっても、\n洋服が、志保の思いを伝え続けてくれるだろうな。", "zh": "啊。即使志保长大成人了，衣服也会继续传达志保的心意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "e313b5199c288d04ddc15873fc64e059bea0fceb5ddc6c67308f4769885c5e3d", "ja": "そうですね。年を重ねても、変わらない思いがある。\nこの服を見る度に思い出すような気がします。", "zh": "是啊。即使年岁增长，也有不变的心意。每次看到这件衣服，我好像都会想起这份心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0544_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "cf78fac78a41bdffd962410d24f5422850ccb15978164650c9e59ba87d439eaa", "ja": "私が初めて考えた服……ふふっ。\n大切に、着ますね。これからも、ずっと。", "zh": "这是我第一次自己设计的衣服……呵呵。\n我会好好珍惜，一直穿下去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
